    <title class="- topic/title " xtrc="title:1;4:12" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/ktcri/OneDrive/Desktop/Harness/harness_user_guide_for_paypal.ditamap">Harness User Guide for PayPal</title>
    <topichead class="+ map/topicref mapgroup-d/topichead " navtitle="Introduction" xtrc="topichead:1;5:40" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/ktcri/OneDrive/Desktop/Harness/harness_user_guide_for_paypal.ditamap"><topicref class="- map/topicref " xtrc="topicref:1;6:45" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/ktcri/OneDrive/Desktop/Harness/harness_user_guide_for_paypal.ditamap" href="Introduction.dita" type="concept"><topicmeta class="- map/topicmeta " data-topic-id="concept_jth_wwj_53c"><resourceid class="- topic/resourceid " oxy-source="topic" appid="concept_jth_wwj_53c"/><navtitle class="- topic/navtitle ">Introduction</navtitle><?ditaot gentext?><linktext class="- map/linktext ">Introduction</linktext><?ditaot genshortdesc?><shortdesc class="- map/shortdesc ">Harness.io manages the full lifecycle of the CI/CD (Continuous Integration/Continuous         Deployment) process. You can define and automate your build, test, and deployment pipelines         using easy-toc-configure YAML files, and the pipelines can also be version-controlled,         making updates and changes simpler. Harness supports parallel execution of jobs, allowing         you to run builds, tests, and deployments simultaneously.</shortdesc></topicmeta></topicref><topichead class="+ map/topicref mapgroup-d/topichead " navtitle="Access and Roles" xtrc="topichead:2;7:49" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/ktcri/OneDrive/Desktop/Harness/harness_user_guide_for_paypal.ditamap"/><topichead class="+ map/topicref mapgroup-d/topichead " navtitle="Training, Support, Resources" xtrc="topichead:3;8:61" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/ktcri/OneDrive/Desktop/Harness/harness_user_guide_for_paypal.ditamap"/></topichead>
